{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NSbhvsss8W1795432594.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>德甲，雲達不來梅主場，大勝漢堡4-0。</p><p></p><p>白衫的不來梅，費度接應角球，頭槌被擋出，球之後輾轉再落到他腳下，他一控一抽，換邊後10分鐘，打破僵局。到66分鐘，尼真馬擺脫守衛後，有隊友搶上，不過最後都由他射遠柱入網，拉開2-0。4分鐘後，尼真馬即熨，射中人少許改變方向，入個人第二球，不來梅贏到3-0。</p><p></p><p>他們上場不敵史特加，聯賽七場不敗走勢告終。富克洛補時2分鐘勁射破網，不來梅大勝4-0，排第六位，漢堡排12。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:13:57.711345+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:40.320728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:07:20.224240+00:00","content_hash":"c4f6b2c7ee40d31b04e3b5416a57d9270a830849144025cf48a905709ceee6e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}